  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you are not incapacitated, Attack Rolls against allies that benefit from your Formation Fighting cannot have Advantage. Additionally, you and all allies under the effect of your Formation Fighting add your Leadership ability modifier to Saving Throws and Ability Checks against being knocked prone, pushed, or otherwise forced to move.</p>",
